 CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvDiplomacyAI.cpp |  2 +-
 CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvMilitaryAI.cpp  | 29 ++++++++++++++++++++--
 CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvMilitaryAI.h    |  4 +--
 3 files changed, 30 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

